 'every 0.5 sec for 15 sec when each pillar of the inferno is created. This effect stacks. The flame '
 'inflicts Fire damage every 1 sec to any players who step into the firestorm.',
 "Venom slime ejected by the Breath of Ula'tek returns to the golem after 4 sec, inflicting Nature damage to "
