 'Vexhul channels a continuous torrent of toxin in a frontal direction for 14 sec, inflicting Nature damage '
 'every 0.5 sec and applying Eternal Venom to players struck.',
 'Vexhul funnels toxin into her current target for 5 sec, inflicting Nature damage every 0.5 sec and '
 'ejecting acid nearby. Each acid splash inflicts Nature damage and applies Eternal Venom to players within '
 '4 yards, forming a Caustic Globule at the impact location.',
 'Vexhul pelts her current target with spittle if they are out of range, inflicting Nature damage.',
 'Vexhul thrashes and churns the surrounding sea of venom for 6 sec, inflicting Nature damage to all players '
