 'and applying Eternal Venom to players struck.',
 'Vexie orders emergency repairs to the Geargrinder causing it to repair its Protective Plating over 45 sec. '
 'Vexie also calls in a crew to assist with the repairs.',
 'Vile acid corrodes the target, suffering Nature damage periodically. This effect stacks.',
 'Vines hold the whelpling in place.',
 'Void Bomb explodes after 5 sec, inflicting Shadow damage to players within 4 yards. Every unit within 4 '
 'yards have their damage done increased by 15% and absorb the next healing.',
 'Void conduits tear open, inflicting Shadow damage to players within 10 yards The conduits teleport players '
