 'Void energy arcs to hit an ally, inflicting Shadow damage.',
 'Void energy erupts from the impact, inflicting Shadow damage to all players.',
 'Void energy remains on the ground, inflicting Shadow damage to all players within it every 1 sec.',
 'Void expulses from the Rift Warden, inflicting Shadow damage to all enemies and additional Shadow damage '
 'to enemies nearby of impact.',
 'Void magic binds the Sentinel to existence, preventing it from dying.',
 'Void magic binds the Voidspawn to existence, preventing it from dying.',
 'Voidspawn rush toward the player with the highest amount of Blackening Wounds for the next 10 sec.',
 'Voidstars project a Gravity Well that inflicts Shadow damage every 1 sec to players within 4 yards and '
 'reduces their movement speed by 30%. Dimensius cannot Devour players affected by a Gravity Well.',
 'Volcoross spews surging fire from his jaws, inflicting Fire damage to all players every 0.5 sec for 5 sec. '
