 'Vorasius devours anything in front of him, instantly killing them.',
 'Vorasius gathers power with each roar, radiating Shadow damage to all players periodically.',
 'Vorasius shakes off parasitic Blistercreeps, spraying the battlefield with globs of dark ichor that '
