 'impact inflicts Shadowstrike damage to all targets instead. This attack also causes void crystals to erupt '
 'from the ground.',
 'Vorasius slams a giant claw into the ground, inflicting Shadow and Physical damage to players in the '
 'impact area and Shadow damage to all players. If the central impact fails to hit at least 1 player, '
 'Vorasius inflicts Shadow damage to all players instead. The impact of the larger claws applies Smashed and '
 'creates Void Crystals.',
 'Vorasius sweeps a deadly beam across the battlefield, immediately inflicting Shadow damage to all players '
 'in front of him and Shadow damage every 1 sec to players caught in its path. The beam radiates Dark Energy '
