 'Vorasius takes a deep breath, pulling players closer before unleashing a deafening roar that inflicts '
 'Physical damage to all players and knocks them away.',
 'Vordaza conjures a shadowy hand which seeks out a player. Upon impact, the hand inflicts Shadow damage to '
 'players within 8 yards and roots any players struck for 10 sec.',
 'Waves of plague venom erupt from the target, inflicting Plague damage to players hit.',
 'Waves of shadowy energy emanate from the Black Blood infused Broodtwister, inflicting Shadow damage and '
 'absorbing the next healing done to all players every 7.5 sec. In addition, waves of Vile Discharge are '
 'released every 7.5 sec.',
 'Weave the unity of shadow and flame, dealing Shadowflame damage to enemies in front.',
 'Web shackles connect to players, slowing them by 10% and inflicting Nature damage every 3 sec until the '
 'shackles are destroyed. The strength of this effect increases over time. The shackles trap any player they '
 'touch in a Royal Cocoon. Destroying a shackle frees its cocooned players.',
