 'When a player touches the froth, it bursts, afflicting them with Concentrated Toxin. This burst launches '
 'players within 8 yards into the air and inflicts Nature damage to all players A glob of venom also '
 'launches, splattering into Toxic Waves. Venom Nova disperses burst froth into a pool of Acid.',
