 'Wild pockets of gravity surge from Alleria, inflicting Shadow damage to players within 6 yards of each '
 'impact and knocking them away.',
 "With each consecutive melee attack against the same target, the casters' attack speed increases by 8%. "
 'This effect stacks.',
